<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Resolute first half profit falls.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Resolute first half profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Australian gold miner Resolute Ltd said on Wednesday its net profit in the six months to December 31 fell to A$15.1 million from A$20.1 million a year ago.</p>
<p>The first half dividend was reduced to one cent from three cents per share.  </p>
<p>The company said gold production rose 30 percent to 136,106 ounces at a cash cost of A$384 per ounce from A$344 a year ago.</p>
<p>It said the average sale price of gold in the latest six months was A$642 per ounce from A$680 a year earlier.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
